<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρομ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>running,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός δ᾽ ἔβαν δρομὰς ἐξ οἴκων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					1000
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντυξ δ.</span> the
				<i>whirling</i> wheel, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				678
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁλκάδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					420
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κάμηλος</span>”
				<i>dromedary,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					19.37
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.2.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				6.14.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				31
			</span></i>: also with a neut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρομάδι κώλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					1301
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δρομάσι βλεφάροις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Or.</u>
					837
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wildly roaming, frantic,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ναΐς, παρθένος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				549
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tr.</u>
				42
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γαλλαὶ μητρὸς ὀρείης φιλόθυρσοι
					δρομάδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Adesp.</u>
					121
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of certain
			fish, <i>migratory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				488a6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>street-walker,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>.</div>
